flowchart TD
  S[dist of source = 0, push to heap] --> P{heap empty?}
  P -->|no| A[pop node with smallest distance]
  A --> OLD{distance is stale?}
  OLD -->|yes| P
  OLD -->|no| R[for each neighbour: new = dist + weight]
  R --> U{new < best known?}
  U -->|yes| PU[update, push to heap] --> P
  U -->|no| P
  P -->|yes| D[done]
